  "label": "User projected onto the textual material mocking sensitivity",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'oh you're triggered?' and 'must be hard being a special snowflake', which directly addresses the viewer as the one who is 'triggered' or 'a special snowflake'. This creates an implicit 'you' in the user's experience, making them the target of the meme's mockery. The projection is onto the textual material, which frames the user as the sensitive or overly emotional person being ridiculed.",
